    "created_at": "2026-07-17T17:26:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-17T17:26:49Z",
    "body": "The redaction is an Android behavior. Android requires the user to grant the app permission to access the device and after that the serial number is revealed to the app. Unfortunately Android does not try to remember the user's past decisions the way Chrome does so every time the device is reconnected the serial number is once again redacted.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
