    "created_at": "2026-07-27T19:01:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-27T19:01:49Z",
    "body": "That is the prompt I was referring to that comes from Android. The browser has to display it if [`UsbManager.hasPermission`](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/usb/UsbManager#hasPermission(android.hardware.usb.UsbDevice)) returns false. It might be possible to override this through Android device-level policies but I'm not familiar with that.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
